  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Checking e.g. a menu button press via `Input.GetButtonDown(\"Oculus_CrossPlatform_Button4\")` doesn't work anymore, while the equivalent `Input.GetButton(\"Oculus_CrossPlatform_Button4\")` works (this was tested with Index Controllers while using the 2019 SDK to confirm that this issue is not limited to the 2022 SDK).\n\nThis bug was already reported during the 2022 beta, but is affecting the live version since a while now. \n\nThere is no equivalent replacement for checking menu buttons in the new input method, so we need to rely on this legacy input method for that. A lot of existing content is affected by this bug.",
